cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Book to Audio Edition: Prompts and Scripts for Listening-Ready Books"
abstract: "Prompts and Python scripts that convert PDF and EPUB books, born-digital or scanned, into clean text-only editions for text-to-speech listening. The workflow removes running heads, page numbers, and note markers, announces chapters, rewrites tables as sentences, and collects notes at the end of the book."
authors:
